1
00:00:00,300 --> 00:00:04,210
This is AstraCore's fictional screenshot tour, with no live pilot data.

2
00:00:04,210 --> 00:00:11,380
On your own profile, connect each EVE character separately, review the permissions, and
check planetary skills and colony slots.

3
00:00:12,380 --> 00:00:16,780
Choose your goal and login routine, then confirm an operating area in guided setup.

4
00:00:16,780 --> 00:00:20,520
Use the detailed Area page to fine tune constellations and the drop off.

5
00:00:20,520 --> 00:00:22,380
Demo Harbour is entirely fictional.

6
00:00:24,380 --> 00:00:26,910
Balance income against the time you spend on upkeep.

7
00:00:26,910 --> 00:00:30,170
Review login frequency, travel, products and selling.

8
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:33,200
These demo comparisons use fixed illustrative figures.

9
00:00:33,200 --> 00:00:36,080
They do not optimize the fictional crew or save changes.

10
00:00:37,080 --> 00:00:40,850
Review production, time, hauling and assumptions before building.

11
00:00:40,850 --> 00:00:44,860
Yield is estimated, while prices, order depth and demand can change.

12
00:00:44,860 --> 00:00:47,670
This summary has no colony allocation or templates.

13
00:00:47,670 --> 00:00:49,270
It is not an executable plan.

14
00:00:50,270 --> 00:00:55,570
After building, Operate highlights your next action, such as a restart, pickup or restock.

15
00:00:55,570 --> 00:00:58,430
Colony data updates after you open the colony in EVE.

16
00:00:58,430 --> 00:01:02,030
Check freshness, then restart extractors and move cargo yourself.

17
00:01:03,030 --> 00:01:08,280
Check routes, docking access, cargo capacity and provider terms before hauling or selling.

18
00:01:08,280 --> 00:01:10,580
Real plans refer to DalShooth's templates.

19
00:01:10,580 --> 00:01:12,380
EVE Online belongs to CCP.

20
00:01:12,380 --> 00:01:15,940
Built by capsuleers and contributors, AstraCore is independent.

21
00:01:15,940 --> 00:01:17,780
Estimates are not guaranteed earnings.
